  282:     #  m88kexcdeliver (#502) and lunaabsentcpu (#503), 2026-09-06: every .py these rounds preserved under
  283:     #  regress/artifacts/ is EVIDENCE -- frozen instruments beside their kill tables, the frozen mutant
  284:     #  generators and fix scripts, and the two measuring seats' own drivers.  Generated from this checker's
  285:     #  own UNCLASSIFIED list; one line per file, deliberately, as the pcc2 block above does.  The SHIPPED
  286:     #  detector m88k_exc_probe.py is the one entry here that is NOT evidence and is classified as a detector,
  287:     #  because the checker's own header warns that a detector misfiled as anything else silences the
  288:     #  requirement; its gate wiring is DERIVED below, not asserted here.
  289:     #  lcairqstubkill (2026-09-08): a WITNESS ATTEMPT, and it did NOT fire.  It is classified as
  290:     #  evidence rather than as a detector because that is what it is -- three controls green, the
  291:     #  assertion never reached the stub, and the round records it as an ATTEMPT rather than as a
  292:     #  negative result, because whether a debugger `put' reaches DEVICE_ACCESS(ns16550) at all is
  293:     #  still open.  A file that pins nothing must not be wired into a gate: it would be a green
  294:     #  row that means nothing, which is the vacuity this whole layer exists to refuse.
