  815: 
  816:     #  wdcaltoffset PASS 1, 2026-08-30.  Four instruments from the measuring seat's
  817:     #  six-binary table.  CLASS_RESEARCH on the precedent two entries down: they are
  818:     #  EVIDENCE preserved so the numbers can be re-run rather than believed.
  819:     #
  820:     #  `table_a.py` is worth a note because it is the reason the table is credible:
  821:     #  it IMPORTS witness_20260829/wdcaltoff_rung3_probe.py rather than
  822:     #  re-implementing the encoder, so it cannot measure a fix of its own invention.
  823:     #  Its fix leg was checked byte-identical to mkfixleg.py's output AND to the
  824:     #  preserved fixleg.diff before any mutant was built.
  825:     #  #494 PASS 2, the opus5 seat.  Instruments preserved so its measured floor
  826:     #  breach can be re-run rather than believed.  `PROPOSED_...` is kept as the
  827:     #  PROVENANCE of what the seat proposed: the shipped detector differs from it
  828:     #  only by an added clause-(e) contract, and keeping both makes that checkable.
  829:     #  wdcaddtoinbufbound RUNG-3 WITNESS, 2026-08-30.  The probe is the INSTRUMENT of
