 1040:     #  MUST NOT BE PRUNED. ***  The older generator inserts `SGIRE_W_UNMAP_WR = 1 << 6',
 1041:     #  and #498/cb28a6f added `SGIRE_W_DE_LEN = 1 << 6' to that same enum.  A duplicate
 1042:     #  enumerator is legal C and silent, and DEVICE_ACCESS(sgi_de) casts the same struct,
 1043:     #  so d->warned is SHARED -- measured as a 14/14 total escape.  This one uses 1<<7/1<<8
 1044:     #  and hard-fails on duplicates.
