138-#  *** THIS CLASS EXISTS BECAUSE THE OBVIOUS FIX WOULD HAVE BROKEN SOMETHING. ***  Making
139-#  the scan recursive immediately pulls in the instruments preserved beside a kill table
140-#  under regress/artifacts/.  A `_probe.py` suffix trips the MISFILED rule if they are
141-#  called tools, while calling them detectors demands a gate they should never have --
142-#  a file with no honest class.  A farmed seat found this and said plainly: land the
143-#  complete path-aware fix WITH this classification, or do not land it at all.
144:CLASSES = (CLASS_DETECTOR, CLASS_WITNESS, CLASS_TOOL, CLASS_RESEARCH)
