1586:#  2026-09-20 matches the fbpending_bound:2026-09-20 deadline already standing in
1587-#  gate_offline.sh's SM_EXEMPT, so #442's two debts fall due together.  IT IS A PROPOSAL: the
1588-#  owner set the SM dates and set them TIGHTER than the ones proposed, and a deadline nobody
1589-#  chose is a deadline nobody owns.
1590-#
