codex
Moving the invocation above `need_file` is not enough: the later missing-image path can still end the gate as SKIP. I’m making the bare-PPC leg finish and fail before that path, then giving the image-less case an explicit partial-coverage note and normal gate finalization. The probe has 27 rows and 495 census cells; the five files do not contain the existing `ppcrldimimask` kill-table leg names.
exec
"C:\\WINDOWS\\System32\\WindowsPowerShell\\v1.0\\powershell.exe" -Command "@'
